{
  "name": "Automate NDA Signing with Form Input and AllSign",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automate NDA signing with a form and AllSign\n\n> **Self-hosted n8n only.** The AllSign community node cannot run on n8n Cloud.\n\n### How it works\n\nA web form collects the client's name, email, optional WhatsApp number, company, project, effective date, confidentiality period and jurisdiction. The workflow fills your AllSign NDA template with those values, creates the document and sends the signing invitation by WhatsApp when a number was given, or by email otherwise. Every signature carries a NOM-151 timestamp.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Install `n8n-nodes-allsign` on your n8n.\n2. **Credentials → Add → AllSign API** and paste an API key from [allsign.io/developers/api-keys](https://allsign.io/developers/api-keys).\n3. Upload `NDA_Template_AllSign.docx` from the node's [examples folder](https://github.com/AllSign-io/n8n-nodes-allsign/tree/main/examples) as a template in AllSign and copy its id (`tmpl_...`).\n4. Paste the id in **Map Form to Template Variables**, or set the n8n variable `allsign_nda_template_id`.\n5. Activate the workflow and share the form URL.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 💡 Tips\n\n- **Template Values** must match the variable names in the template: `client_name`, `company_name`, `effective_date`, `project_description`, `confidentiality_period` and `governing_law` in `NDA_Template_AllSign.docx`. A name that doesn't match is left unfilled.\n- **WhatsApp** is optional: the invitation goes by WhatsApp only when a number is given, otherwise by email.\n- **Role Name** (`client`) assigns template variables tagged with that role to this signer.\n- **Signature Validations** can be changed in the Create node: Handwritten, NOM-151, FEA, Biometric Selfie, ID Scan and Video Signature.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-tips",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [180, 540]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "NDA Request Form",
        "formDescription": "Fill out this form to generate and send a Non-Disclosure Agreement for electronic signature via AllSign.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Client Full Name",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "e.g. Jane Smith"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Client Email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "e.g. jane@company.com"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Client WhatsApp (Optional)",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": false,
              "placeholder": "e.g. +525512345678"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Company Name (Disclosing Party)",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "e.g. Acme Corp"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Project Description",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "e.g. Software development collaboration for Project X"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Effective Date",
              "fieldType": "date",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Confidentiality Period",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "requiredField": true,
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  { "option": "1 year" },
                  { "option": "2 years" },
                  { "option": "3 years" },
                  { "option": "5 years" },
                  { "option": "Indefinite" }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Governing Law / Jurisdiction",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "requiredField": true,
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  { "option": "Mexico City, Mexico" },
                  { "option": "State of California, USA" },
                  { "option": "Madrid, Spain" },
                  { "option": "Bogotá, Colombia" },
                  { "option": "Buenos Aires, Argentina" },
                  { "option": "London, United Kingdom" }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "respondToWebhook": true,
          "formSubmittedText": "✅ Your NDA has been created and sent for signature!\n\nThe signer will receive an invitation via email (or WhatsApp, if provided) to review and sign the NDA electronically."
        }
      },
      "id": "form-trigger",
      "name": "NDA Request Form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [220, 300],
      "webhookId": "nda-form-allsign"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "set-doc-name",
              "name": "documentName",
              "value": "=NDA - {{ $json['Client Full Name'] }} - {{ $json['Company Name (Disclosing Party)'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-template-id",
              "name": "templateId",
              "value": "={{ $vars.allsign_nda_template_id || 'tmpl_REPLACE_ME' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-client-name",
              "name": "clientName",
              "value": "={{ $json['Client Full Name'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-client-email",
              "name": "clientEmail",
              "value": "={{ $json['Client Email'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-client-whatsapp",
              "name": "clientWhatsapp",
              "value": "={{ $json['Client WhatsApp (Optional)'] || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-company-name",
              "name": "companyName",
              "value": "={{ $json['Company Name (Disclosing Party)'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-project-desc",
              "name": "projectDescription",
              "value": "={{ $json['Project Description'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-eff-date",
              "name": "effectiveDate",
              "value": "={{ $json['Effective Date'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-conf-period",
              "name": "confidentialityPeriod",
              "value": "={{ $json['Confidentiality Period'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-gov-law",
              "name": "governingLaw",
              "value": "={{ $json['Governing Law / Jurisdiction'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-template-values",
              "name": "templateValuesJson",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify({ client_name: $json['Client Full Name'], company_name: $json['Company Name (Disclosing Party)'], effective_date: $json['Effective Date'], project_description: $json['Project Description'], confidentiality_period: $json['Confidentiality Period'], governing_law: $json['Governing Law / Jurisdiction'] }) }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "set-variables",
      "name": "Map Form to Template Variables",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [480, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "document",
        "operation": "createDocument",
        "documentName": "={{ $('Map Form to Template Variables').item.json.documentName }}",
        "source": "template",
        "templateId": "={{ $('Map Form to Template Variables').item.json.templateId }}",
        "configuration": {
          "templateValues": "={{ $('Map Form to Template Variables').item.json.templateValuesJson }}"
        },
        "signers": {
          "signerValues": [
            {
              "name": "={{ $('Map Form to Template Variables').item.json.clientName }}",
              "deliveryMethod": "={{ $('Map Form to Template Variables').item.json.clientWhatsapp ? 'whatsapp' : 'email' }}",
              "email": "={{ $('Map Form to Template Variables').item.json.clientEmail }}",
              "whatsapp": "={{ $('Map Form to Template Variables').item.json.clientWhatsapp }}",
              "roleName": "client"
            }
          ]
        },
        "signatureValidations": {
          "verifyAutografa": true
        }
      },
      "id": "allsign-create",
      "name": "AllSign: Create NDA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-allsign.allsign",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [740, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "allSignApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "AllSign API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "document",
        "operation": "sendDocument",
        "documentId": "={{ $json.id }}"
      },
      "id": "allsign-send",
      "name": "AllSign: Send NDA for Signature",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-allsign.allsign",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1000, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "allSignApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "AllSign API"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "NDA Request Form": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Map Form to Template Variables",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
